@host = http://localhost:5213

### Create a cross-border flow DK2 -> SE4 (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "DK2",
  "toBiddingZone": "SE4",
  "resolution": "PT15M",
  "start": "2026-11-13T00:00:00Z",
  "unit": "MW",
  "points": [
    { "position": 1, "quantity": 412.5 },
    { "position": 2, "quantity": 398.0 },
    { "position": 3, "quantity": 405.25 },
    { "position": 4, "quantity": 420.0 }
  ]
}

### Same instant, written with an offset: 01:00+01:00 is 00:00Z (expect 201, start returned as 00:00 UTC)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "resolution": "PT60M",
  "start": "2026-11-13T01:00:00+01:00",
  "unit": "MWh",
  "points": [ { "position": 1, "quantity": 250 }, { "position": 2, "quantity": 260 } ]
}

### Filter by zone and overlapping interval (expect 200 with the flow)
GET {{host}}/api/timeseries?biddingZone=SE4&from=2026-11-13T00:30:00Z&to=2026-11-13T02:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Filter with an offset: "+" must be written as %2B in a URL (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/api/timeseries?from=2026-11-13T01:30:00%2B01:00&to=2026-11-13T03:00:00%2B01:00
Accept: application/json

### Invalid: flow to the same zone (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CrossBorderFlow",
  "biddingZone": "DK2",
  "toBiddingZone": "DK2",
  "resolution": "PT60M",
  "start": "2026-11-13T00:00:00Z",
  "points": [ { "position": 1, "quantity": 100 } ]
}

### Invalid: numeric enum (expect 400, and the store is not poisoned)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "resolution": 99,
  "start": "2026-11-13T00:00:00Z",
  "points": [ { "position": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Invalid: start without Z or offset (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "resolution": "PT60M",
  "start": "2026-10-25T00:00:00",
  "points": [ { "position": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Invalid: unknown unit and missing quantity (expect 400 with both errors)
POST {{host}}/api/timeseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Production",
  "biddingZone": "DK1",
  "resolution": "PT60M",
  "start": "2026-11-13T00:00:00Z",
  "unit": "banana",
  "points": [ { "position": 1 } ]
}

### Unknown id (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/timeseries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health check (expect 200 Healthy)
GET {{host}}/health